r8s-woa — Windows on the Samsung Galaxy S20 FE (Exynos 990)

This project builds on and reuses material from:

- Project Silicium / Mu-Silicium (https://github.com/Project-Silicium/Mu-Silicium)
  BSD-2-Clause / BSD-2-Clause-Patent. The files under firmware/overlay/ are
  modified copies of Mu-Silicium's r8sPkg and x1sPkg (Platforms/Samsung) and
  of Silicium-ACPI's x1s AcpiTables.inf, and keep their original headers.
- Microsoft Project Mu (BSD-2-Clause-Patent).
- ntdevlabs/exynos9810-woa and ilyatbn/exynos-woa (BSD-2-Clause-Patent):
  project structure, install flow and driver plan.
- Linux exynos990-r8s.dts by Denzeel Oliva (GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause): memory
  layout facts used to derive the r8s memory map (no code copied).
- Itzkristis/r8q-arch: reference for the FTS5CU56A touch protocol (no code copied).
